WEBVTT

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:06.220 --> 00:12.920
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:13.500 --> 00:19.260
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:24.770
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:25.280 --> 00:31.370
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:31.480 --> 00:37.350
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:37.450 --> 00:40.420
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.490
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:50.360 --> 00:53.260
<b>I'll use that Takuro
and that Takuro...</b>

00:53.360 --> 00:58.060
<b>and feature them in a
naughty doujinshi nyo.</b>

00:58.170 --> 01:00.730
<b>You're coming up with
an evil scheme again gema.</b>

01:00.840 --> 01:03.900
<b>If you're thinking of using
a handsome young man and boy...</b>

01:04.010 --> 01:07.270
<b>to make naughty doujinshi
to make money at a convention,</b>

01:07.380 --> 01:08.540
<b>you'd better not gema.</b>

01:09.510 --> 01:11.810
<b>You hit the nail on the head nyo!
How annoying nyo!</b>

01:17.390 --> 01:21.480
<b>It's hard work to punish
a nagging goody-two-shoes nyo.</b>

01:21.590 --> 01:23.320
<b>You're so mean.</b>

01:23.900 --> 01:26.890
<b>I know he's just a round
ball-like creature,</b>

01:27.000 --> 01:30.130
<b>but you shouldn't pick on him
so much, Dejiko-chan.</b>

01:30.240 --> 01:32.800
<b>Another goody-two-shoes
showed up nyo.</b>

01:33.340 --> 01:35.830
<b>You must be lonely.</b>

01:35.940 --> 01:39.810
<b>Now he's starting to preach nyo!
My head is spinning nyo!</b>

01:39.910 --> 01:44.250
<b>Dejiko-kun, I don't know
what Gema-kun did, but,</b>

01:44.350 --> 01:47.810
<b>you shouldn't solve things
with violence.</b>

01:47.920 --> 01:51.720
<b>Puchiko-chan. Did you want to
join me for some shiruko?</b>

01:51.820 --> 01:52.690
<b>No nyu.</b>

01:52.790 --> 01:55.020
<b>I don't want someone like him
judging me either nyo.</b>

01:55.130 --> 01:56.090
<b>You idiot!!!</b>

01:56.190 --> 01:59.560
<b>Sign : Please feel free to take one</b>

01:57.600 --> 01:59.560
<b>How mean nyo!
What are you doing nyo!?</b>

01:59.660 --> 02:03.600
<b>You...you...should know by now.</b>

02:04.000 --> 02:06.100
<b>You can't lie to your heart!</b>

02:06.200 --> 02:10.230
<b>He sounds very dangerous.
I'll pretend they're not there nyo.</b>

02:12.180 --> 02:13.640
<b>Live today to its fullest!</b>

02:13.750 --> 02:16.040
<b>It's high, right, Puchiko-chan?
Put me down.</b>

02:16.150 --> 02:19.610
<b>Why do weird people
all gather at this store nyo?</b>

02:20.350 --> 02:22.110
<b>There's a big yellow!</b>

02:22.220 --> 02:24.620
<b>It's yellow! It's yellow!</b>

02:24.720 --> 02:27.850
<b>I fell into the river
and got soaked gema!</b>

02:27.960 --> 02:30.450
<b>It's only Gema nyo.</b>

02:30.560 --> 02:31.720
<b>Please help me gema.</b>

02:31.830 --> 02:34.460
<b>I mean,
I order you to help me gema!!</b>

02:35.000 --> 02:36.360
<b>C'mon! C'mon gema.</b>

02:36.470 --> 02:39.800
<b>We've never been in this
kind of trouble before nyo!</b>

02:39.900 --> 02:43.340
<b>C'mon! C'mon!
Where are you running to gema?</b>

02:43.440 --> 02:44.810
<b>There's no use in running gema!</b>

02:44.910 --> 02:47.810
<b>Puchiko has no reason
to be chased by Gema nyu.</b>

02:47.910 --> 02:49.880
<b>That's right gema.</b>

02:49.980 --> 02:53.310
<b>It's you who I'm after, De-ji-ko.</b>

02:53.790 --> 02:55.310
<b>Oh no! A dead end nyo!</b>

02:55.990 --> 02:58.180
<b>It's over nyo!</b>

02:59.820 --> 03:02.420
<b>Give up gema.</b>

03:03.030 --> 03:05.330
<b>I'm gonna crush you gema.</b>

03:05.430 --> 03:09.420
<b>Red bean might come out gema.</b>

03:09.530 --> 03:10.500
<b>No! No!</b>

03:10.600 --> 03:15.040
<b>A lukewarm yellow thing
is pushing against me nyo.</b>

03:15.140 --> 03:16.830
<b>It feels gross nyo.</b>

03:17.480 --> 03:19.670
<b>I need to go
to the bathroom gema.</b>

03:19.780 --> 03:21.640
<b>Wait here gema.</b>

03:22.850 --> 03:28.250
<b>I could still feel the stinky
lukewarm yellow thing nyo.</b>

03:28.350 --> 03:29.580
<b>I'm back gema.</b>

03:29.690 --> 03:31.850
<b>Huh? What?</b>

03:31.960 --> 03:36.220
<b>I guess all the water left
when I went to the bathroom gema.</b>

03:37.330 --> 03:38.590
<b>Burn!</b>

03:38.700 --> 03:40.060
<b>Let's not think about...</b>

03:40.160 --> 03:44.460
<b>where and how much
Gema went to the bathroom, okay kids?</b>
